      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N4-01",
          "text": "The next morning.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-01",
          "text": "The children slept through you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-02",
          "text": "After the morning post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-02",
          "text": "Take this copy to Kiva. If she needs a return address, offer ours.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-03",
          "text": "Kiva. Blue awning, west court.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-03",
          "text": "ArenI will start with hello.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-06",
          "text": "Rusk sent us.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-06",
          "text": "KivaDid he finally fit those hinges?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-07",
          "text": "A commission with my own mark. If my answer misses the noon packet, they ask the next maker.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-08",
          "text": "This came with Lower Post\u2019s answer. It names Bell Basin too.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-09",
          "text": "Closed? I opened at six.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-10",
          "text": "They need a return address for the acknowledgment. The post will not accept mine.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "Use Lower Post. Ossa offered.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "KivaAnd you will bring their answer?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-11",
          "text": "ArenI will bring it here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-12",
          "text": "The crate pays more. It takes a barrow down the ramp.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-13",
          "text": "I\u2019m saving for a room. Can the hinges wait until tomorrow?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-13",
          "text": "KivaThe brass can. My answer cannot.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-14",
          "text": "Then the answer goes first.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-14",
          "text": "KivaThe letter fee, on its dispatch receipt.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-15",
          "text": "Kiva, care of Lower Post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-17",
          "text": "You will have to come back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-17",
          "text": "ArenI know the door now.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-18",
          "text": "At the quay, the second bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-18",
          "text": "KivaIt leaves on the third.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-20",
          "text": "That upright is part of the wall. The stair beyond it goes to the quay.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-23",
          "text": "Hold.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-25",
          "text": "For the noon packet.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-26",
          "text": "Kiva, care of Lower Post. That contact is on the current round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-27",
          "text": "Accepted for today\u2019s packet.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-28",
          "text": "The third bell.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-29",
          "text": "On time?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-29",
          "text": "ArenOn today\u2019s packet.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-30",
          "text": "Where do Bell Basin\u2019s returns go?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-30",
          "text": "MernBell Basin\u2019s returns still go to Ninth Store. It says temporary.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-31",
          "text": "Who keeps the return desk?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-31",
          "text": "MernToma. Ask at Ninth Store.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-33",
          "text": "They took it. The packet has gone.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-34",
          "text": "Now the work has a chance.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-35",
          "text": "The letter fee. As agreed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-36",
          "text": "Can you collect on market days?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-36",
          "text": "ArenAfter Lower Post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-37",
          "text": "The bindery lets a room. I can introduce you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-38",
          "text": "I am still saving.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-38",
          "text": "KivaThen come and see it before you promise anything.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-39",
          "text": "Tomorrow, the return desk?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N4-39",
          "text": "ArenAfter the morning post.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
